"""Self-contained local review controls with source-owned diagnostic PNGs."""
import argparse,json
from pathlib import Path


def main():
    ap=argparse.ArgumentParser(description=__doc__);ap.add_argument('out',type=Path);a=ap.parse_args();out=a.out.resolve()
    views=['oblique','reverse','top','bottom','front','back','end'];images={}
    for source in (4268930,4527988):
        images[str(source)]={}
        for view in views:
            images[str(source)][view]={stage:str(out/str(source)/(stage+'-'+view+'.png')) for stage in ['current','trial']+(['wire','support'] if view in ['oblique','bottom'] else [])}
    html='''<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><style>
body{font:14px var(--font-sans,system-ui);color:var(--foreground,#ddd);margin:0}p{line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted-foreground,#999)}strong{color:var(--foreground,#ddd)}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;margin:12px 0}th,td{text-align:right;padding:9px 4px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border,#444)}th:first-child,td:first-child{text-align:left}th{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted-foreground,#999)}select{font:inherit;color:var(--foreground,#ddd);background:var(--card,#222);border:1px solid var(--border,#444);padding:6px;border-radius:5px;max-width:100%}.controls{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:18px 0 8px}label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}.pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}figure{margin:0}img{display:block;width:100%;border-radius:5px}figcaption{font-size:12px;margin:6px 0;color:var(--muted-foreground,#999)}small{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted-foreground,#999)}.legend{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;margin-right:5px}h3{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 6px}
</style></head><body>
<p><strong>The crossbar has a useful targeted saving. The housing needs a different pass.</strong></p>
<table><thead><tr><th>Visual triangles / Base member</th><th>Approved</th><th>Trial</th><th>Result</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Top crossbar</td><td>39,790</td><td>18,626</td><td>−53.2%</td></tr><tr><td>Lower outer housing</td><td>21,620</td><td>28,326</td><td>Rejected</td></tr></tbody></table>
<div class="controls"><label>Part <select id="part"><option value="4268930">Top crossbar</option><option value="4527988">Lower outer housing</option></select></label><label>View <select id="view">VIEWS</select></label><label>Right image <select id="mode"><option value="trial">Bore closure trial</option><option value="wire">Approved triangle edges</option><option value="support">Approved plane classification</option></select></label></div>
<div class="pair"><figure><img id="left" alt="Approved member"><figcaption>Approved visual</figcaption></figure><figure><img id="right" alt="Diagnostic comparison"><figcaption id="rightcaption"></figcaption></figure></div><p id="description"></p>
<h3>Where the current cost is concentrated</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Current member</th><th>On native planes</th><th>Other triangles</th><th>Area on planes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Crossbar</td><td>16,617</td><td>23,173</td><td>79.2%</td></tr><tr><td>Housing</td><td>10,488</td><td>11,132</td><td>72.5%</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p><span class="legend" style="background:#2ea3a1"></span>Teal: triangles matched to original supporting planes. <span class="legend" style="background:#ef7024"></span>Orange: unmatched triangles, including curved detail and modified relief. Supporting-plane matches do not establish original finite-face ownership.</p>
<p>The housing already had <strong>422 small bores filled</strong>. Its two broad sheet planes now account for only <strong>3,176 triangles</strong>. Target narrow returns, cutout borders and local relief, then refine failing patches individually. Treat confirmed flat markings separately; neutral-coloured geometry also includes real raised parts.</p>
<p>The crossbar trial closes 66 small bores, retaining other native faces and their source colours before bounded LOD. It would leave <strong>115,818 visual triangles per Base</strong> (−15.5%). Collision stays at 16,857. No approved model or installed asset has changed.</p>
<small>Review: 7 isolated views per part and 18 whole-Base views with only the crossbar trial substituted. Maximum whole-image RGB change above 10/255: 0.05744%; foreground change relative to existing foreground: 0.01776%. Intentional bore closure reaches 5.34 mm sampled difference inside removed bore walls; samples outside expanded bore envelopes stay within 1 mm. Fixed source-pose diagnostic rendering, not runtime PBR or moving-pose equivalence. Source geometry: DJI / RoboMaster.</small>
<script>const images=IMAGES;const part=document.getElementById('part'),view=document.getElementById('view'),mode=document.getElementById('mode');function update(){let data=images[part.value][view.value];for(let option of mode.options)option.disabled=!data[option.value];if(!data[mode.value])mode.value='trial';document.getElementById('left').src=data.current;document.getElementById('right').src=data[mode.value];document.getElementById('rightcaption').textContent=mode.selectedOptions[0].textContent;document.getElementById('description').textContent=mode.value==='trial'?(part.value==='4268930'?'Crossbar: 66 complete circular bores closed; no increase to the existing 1 mm sampled LOD guard. Small holes intentionally change.':'Housing: this trial is rejected. Global refinement of the grey material makes it larger despite closing three additional 12 mm bores.'):mode.value==='wire'?'Depth-tested triangle ownership edges reveal the approved model’s detail concentration.':'Approved geometry recoloured for diagnosis only. Source materials are unchanged in every trial.';}part.onchange=view.onchange=mode.onchange=update;update();</script></body></html>'''
    html=html.replace('VIEWS',''.join('<option>'+v+'</option>' for v in views)).replace('IMAGES',json.dumps(images));(out/'review.html').write_text(html)
if __name__=='__main__':main()
